89180, "avatar": "00b2c6a3da6007211ddfb210b9b4b21f18e31595"}, "language": "english", "review": "Something about it is just fun. It runs well, it's easy to pick up and play, and there's a lot of replayability. The achievements are fun to grind as well.", "timestamp_created": 1690149285, "timestamp_updated": 1690149285, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142668325", "author": {"steamid": "76561199223575844", "personaname": "katalyst", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199223575844/", "num_games_owned": 43, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1144, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 816, "last_played": 1747876751, "avatar": "b3877044cdfff2ddb4288f670e0656064d9f1b2d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I rate this game 🦀/10", "timestamp_created": 1690147837, "timestamp_updated": 1690147837, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142668300", "author": {"steamid": "76561199156291021", "personaname": "Ecvus_0tyrin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199156291021/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11410, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2293, "last_played": 1788442194, "avatar": "cc00106310b1ad060b0cbab659b262b70644e2d6"}, "language": "english", "review": "On the surface, this game looks hilarious. A crab-warfare game made by the dude who made Crab Rave? Sign me tf up! BUT, underneath that is one of the best dungeon CRAWLers I have ever played, AND it is co-op (which seems to be fairly rare for the genre)! This is such an amazing game and was a VERY good purchase for me (which includes the 3 extra copies I bought for my buddies lol) $40 WELL spent, every moment, Good, Bad, & hilarious, was way more than worth the price tag. Easily the most highly recommended dungeon crawler I have ever had the pleasure to play!", "timestamp_created": 1690147809, "timestamp_updated": 1690147809, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142668102", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124477826", "personaname": "Pwetty Pwincess", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jtoanet/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 672, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 526, "last_played": 1704598131, "avatar": "c8f03775dab17cc0d319fb30d5fa6c6a5156af04"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really Fun", "timestamp_created": 1690147569, "timestamp_updated": 1690147569, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142666872", "author": {"steamid": "76561198315680974", "personaname": "SirSandman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198315680974/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 274, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 208, "last_played": 1691369226, "avatar": "248d0210f3b4a684751ecc765eb7cc659eff004c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Crabsouls, Ultracrab, and Risk of Crab 2 all in one!\n\nPositive:\n\nGraphics 9/10: Very bright and flashy. It would be cool if the game had the same graphics quality as the music video.\n\nGameplay 10/10: A fluid movement system mixed with fun gunplay makes for an amazing gameplay experience. Even for early access, there is a nice variety of enemies.\n\nSoundtrack 10/10: This game was made by a Music Artist, so of course it's going to have a good OST. I am going to call this genre \"Steel Drum n' Bass\".\n\nNegative:\n\nThe enemies need to make more noise. Often times I would die because a puffer fish snuck up behind me without me noticing and exploded.\n\nI'm guessing this is going to change in future updates, but some of the character skins can be unlocked multiple times through different achievments, which kind of defeats the point in completing them.\n\nOther notes:\n\n\"You are gone\" lmao\n\nI'm surprised Crab Rave doesn't play in this game, considering that is the song this game is based on. I'm guessing it couldn't be included due to licensing issues, but I still think it should be added.\n\nThis game was Originally teased as an April Fools joke, but now it's an actual game. I guess the joke was that it was real?\n\nThe crossbow is stupidly Overpowered (PLEASE DON'T NERF IT!!!)\n_____________________________\nFinal Score: 9/10\n\nOnce this game leaves early access, it could become one of the greatest Crab-Themed games in video game history\n\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1690146002, "timestamp_updated": 1690146002, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "142666422", "author": {"steamid": "76561199179847036", "pers